ch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 Paris, husband to Helen with the lovely hair,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 hoisted his fine armour on his shoulders. On his shins, }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 [330]}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 he clipped leg armour fitted with silver ankle clasps.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 Then he put around his chest the body armour}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 belonging to his brother Lycaon. It fit him well. }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\f