\f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 of Crethon and Orsilochus to Achaean troops,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 placed the two dead heroes in the hands of friends,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 then turned back to fight with those in the front ranks.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \par }\pard \plain \s57 \li0 \ri0 \sb0 \sa0 \sbauto1 \saauto1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \toplinepunct1 \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \loch \af0 \hich \af0 \dbch \af2 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf1 {\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 Antilochus and Menelaus then killed Pylaemenes,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 a man like Ares, leader of the Paphlagonians,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 great-hearted, shield-bearing men. The son of Atreus,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 famous spearman Menelaus, struck him,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 as he stood up in his chariot, hitting him}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 right on his collar bone. Antilochus hit Mydon,}{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 680}{\fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \tab }{\fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 [580]}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 Atymnius\uc1 \u8217 ? noble son, the attendant driver,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 as he was wheeling his sure-footed horses round.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 He struck him with a rock square on the elbow.}{\fs24 \rtlch