angnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 On his head he set a cap of marten skin,}{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 400}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 grabbed a sharp spear, and set off, going from the camp}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 towards the ships. He would not be coming back,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 bringing Hector information from the ships.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 But when he left the crowd of men and horses,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 he went eagerly along the path. As he moved,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 noble Odysseus saw him and said to Diomedes:}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \tab }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \tab }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \tab }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \tab }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \tab }{\fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 [340]}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \par }\pard \plain \s53 \li288 \ri0 \sa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin288 \rin0 \itap0 \fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \loch \af6 \hich \af0 \dbch \af2 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf1 {\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \uc1 \u8220 ?Diomedes, someone\uc1 \u8217 ?s coming from the camp.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 I don\uc1 \u8217 ?t know if he\uc1 \u8217 ?s going to scout our ships}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 or strip some dead man\uc1 \u8217 ?s corpse. Let\uc1 \u8217 ?s let him}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 at first get past us on the plain, just a bit.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 410}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 Then we can go after him and catch him fast.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 If his feet outrun ours, we\uc1 \u8217 ?ll keep following him}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 and chase him from his camp towards our ships.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 Keep brandishing your spear behind him,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 so he doesn\uc1 \u8217 ?t make it to the city.\uc1 \u8221 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \par }\pard \plain \s57 \li0 \ri0 \sb0 \sa0 \sbauto1 \saauto1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \loch \af0 \hich \af0 \dbch \af2 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf1 {\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 After these words, the two men lay down beside the road,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 among the corpses. Dolon ran past them quickly,}{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 [350]}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 quite unaware. When he\uc1 \u8217 ?d gone about as far}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \