\af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 by dogs and farmers, who keep watch all night long}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 to stop it tearing some well-fed cow to pieces,}{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 [550]}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 but the beast, ravenous for meat, keeps charging in,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 without success, for a storm of spears rains down on him,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 thrown by eager hands, followed then by burning sticks,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 which, for all his fierce desire, make him afraid,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 so, at dawn, he slinks away in bitter disappointment\uc1 \u8212 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 that\uc1 \u8217 ?s how Ajax most unwillingly retreated then,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 away from Trojans, his spirit in distress.}{\*\bkmkend _Hlk22047780}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 He was very much afraid for the Achaean ships.}{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 630}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\*\bkmkstart _Hlk22047903}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 Just as when some donkey taken past a cornfield\uc1 \u8212 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 a stubborn beast on whose sides many sticks are broken\uc1 \u8212 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 bolts from boys tending it and goes to munch deep corn,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 while boys beat it with sticks\uc1 \u8212 ?although their strength is small,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \tab }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \tab }{\fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 [560]}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 at last they drive it out, once it\uc1 \u8217 ?s had its fill\uc1 \u8212 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 that\uc1 \u8217 ?s how proud Trojans and allies from many lands}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langn