ch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 to see if they\uc1 \u8217 ?d retreat from him as he came forward}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 covered by his shield. But Achaean hearts stood firm.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 The first fighter to challenge Hector was great Ajax,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 who marched out with long strides and shouted:}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \sa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \loch \af6 \hich \af0 \dbch \af2 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf1 {\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \par }\pard \plain \s53 \li288 \ri0 \sa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin288 \rin0 \itap0 \fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \loch \af6 \hich \af0 \dbch \af2 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf1 {\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0                                                       \uc1 \u8220 ?Come closer,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\fs24 \