 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 in their own city, as if he were a god.\uc1 \u8221 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \par }\pard \plain \s57 \li0 \ri0 \sb0 \sa0 \sbauto1 \saauto1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \loch \af0 \hich \af0 \dbch \af2 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf1 {\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 Achilles finished. Then on noble Hector\uc1 \u8217 ?s corpse}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 he carried out a monstrous act. He cut through}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 the tendons behind both feet, from heel to ankle,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 threaded them with ox-hide thongs, and then tied these}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 onto his chariot, leaving the head to drag behind.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 He climbed up in his chariot, brought on the splendid armour,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 then lashed his horses. They sped off eagerly,}{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 500}{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \cf0 \tab }{\fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 [400]}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 dragging Hector. A dust cloud rose above him,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 his dark hair spread out round him, and Hector\uc1 \u8217 ?s head,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 once so handsome, was covered by the dust, for Zeus}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 had given him to his enemies to dishonour}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 in his own native land. So all his head grew dirty.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \par }\pard \plain \s57 \li0 \ri0 \sb0 \sa0 \sbauto1 \saauto1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \loch \af0 \hich \af0 \dbch \af2 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf1 {\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 When she saw her son, his mother pulled her hair,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 threw off her shining veil, and began to shriek.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 His dear father gave a pitiful groan. Around them,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 people were overwhelmed with wailing and laments}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 throughout the city. It was as if all Ilion}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \tab }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \tab }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \tab }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \tab }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \tab }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \tab }{\fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 510}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \uc1 \u160 ?}{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \cf0 \uc1 \u160 ?}{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \cf0 \tab }{\fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 [410]}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 were engulfed in flames, all over the summit}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 of that towering rock. The people then had trouble}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 restraining the old man in his frantic grief,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 his desperate wish to go through the Dardanian gate.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 He begged them all, grovelling in the dirt, calling out,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 naming each of them:}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \par }\pard \plain \s53 \li288 \ri0 \sa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin288 \rin0 \itap0 \fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \loch \af6 \hich \af0 \dbch \af2 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf1 {\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0                                          \uc1 \u8220 ?My dear friends,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 leave me alone. I know you care for me,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 but let me leave the city by myself,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 go to the Achaean ships, then beg him,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 that ruthless man, that violent monster.}{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f0 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 520}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 He may feel shame in front of comrades.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 He may pity my old age. For he, too,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 has a father, one just like me, Peleus,}{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f0 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f0 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af