m as much as I do for one,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 for Hector. The sharp pain I feel for him}{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f0 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 530}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 will bring me down to the house of Hades.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 If only he had died here in my arms,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 we could have had our fill of weeping,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 of lamentation\uc1 \u8212 ?me and his mother,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 who gave birth to him, to her own sorrow.\uc1 \u8221 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \par }\pard \plain \s57 \li0 \ri0 \sb0 \sa0 \sbauto1 \saauto1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \loch \af0 \hich \af0 \dbch \af2 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf1 {\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 As he said this, Priam wept. The townsfolk mourned.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 Hecuba led Trojan women in their loud laments:}{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 [430]}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \par }\pard \plain \s53 \li288 \ri0 \sa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin288 \rin0 \itap0 \fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \loch \af6 \hich \af0 \dbch \af2 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf1 {\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \uc1 \u8220 ?My child, how can I live with this misery,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 such wretched sorrow, now that you are dead?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 You were my pride and joy, night and day,}{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f0 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f0 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 540}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 and in the city, a blessing to us all,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 to Trojan men and women in the state,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 who received you like a god. To them}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 you were great glory when you were alive.}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 Now Death and Fate have overtaken you.\uc1 \u8221 ?}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \par }\pard \plain \s57 \li0 \ri0 \sb0 \sa0 \sbauto1 \saauto1 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \loch \af0 \hich \af0 \dbch \af2 \lang1033 \langnp1033 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf1 {\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 Hecuba spoke through her tears. But so far Hector\uc1 \u8217 ?s wife}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 knew nothing of all this, for no messenger}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 had come to tell her clearly that her husband}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 had remained outside the gates. She was in a room}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 inside their lofty home, weaving purple fabric}{\cs31 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \cf0 \tab }{