langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 black night eclipsed her eyes. She fell back in a faint,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 gasping her life away. From her head she threw off}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 her shining headdress\uc1 \u8212 ?frontlet, cap, woven headband,}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 the veil that golden Aphrodite gave her}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \tab }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \tab }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \tab }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \tab }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \tab }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \tab }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 \tab }{\fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \langfenp1033 \cf0 [470]}{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af6 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe1033 \lan