 \afs20 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf1 This is a reference to the famous Judgment of Paris, in which he was asked to select a goddess to receive a golden apple inscribed \uc1 \u8220 ?for the fairest woman.\uc1 \u8221 ?\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?Hera, Athena, and Aphrodite all claimed the apple, and each offered Paris a bribe (Hera said she would make Paris a supreme political ruler, Athena said she would give him wisdom, and Aphrodite said she would give him the most beautiful mortal woman).\uc1 \u160 ?\uc1 \u160 ?Paris, then a shepherd on Mount Ida, awarded the apple to Aphrodite.\uc1 \u160 ?The whole affair was initiated by Eris, goddess of strife, and became the long-term cause of the Trojan War. }}}{\rtlch \fcs1 \af6 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af6 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af6 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\rtlch \fcs1 \af6 \afs24 \ltrch \fcs0 \fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \tab }{\fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 [30]}{\fs18 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \par }\pard \plain \li0 \ri0 \sa0 \widctlpar \aspalpha \aspnum \adjustright \lin0 \rin0 \itap0 \fs20 \rtlch \ltrch \loch \af6 \hich \af0 \dbch \af2 \lang4105 \langnp4105 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf1 {\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af0 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp2057 \langfe4105 \langfenp4105 \cf0 \line }{\fs24 \rtlch \ltrch \dbch \af2 \hich \af6 \loch \f6 \lang2057 \langnp205